    患者性别(PatientGender String)
    患者出生日期(PatientBirthDate DateTime?)
    发起方患者标识(InitiatorPatientKey String?)
    证件号(PatientIdCardNo String?)
    联系电话(PatientPhoneNumber String?)
    就诊类型(VisitType VisitType)
    发起方就诊标识(InitiatorVisitKey String?)
    门诊号(OutpatientNo String?)
    住院号(InpatientNo String?)
    体检号(PhysicalExamNo String?)
    病区编码(WardCode String?)
    病区名称(WardName String?)
    床号(BedNo String?)
    就诊时间(VisitTime DateTime?)
    开单时间(OrderingTime DateTime?)
    主诉(ChiefComplaint Text?)
    既往史(PastHistory Text?)
    诊断编码(DiagnosisCode String?)
    诊断名称(Diagnosis String?)
    诊断描述(DiagnosisDescription Text?)
    临床备注(ClinicalRemark Text?)
    是否绿色通道(IsGreenChannel Boolean)
    绿色通道说明(GreenChannelDescription Text?)
    审核结果(ReviewResult ApplicationReviewResult?)
    审核人ID(ReviewerId String?)
    审核人(ReviewerName String?)
    审核时间(ReviewTime DateTime?)
    审核备注(ReviewRemark Text?)
    取消原因(CancelReason ApplicationCancelReason?)
    取消说明(CancelDescription Text?)
    取消发起方(CancelledByOrg String?)
    取消时间(CancelTime DateTime?)
    单据状态(ApplicationState ApplicationState)
    备注(Remark Text?)
    创建时间(CreatedTime DateTime)
    --规则--
    1.ApplicationState 是持久化主流程状态，由申请取消、申请单审核和有效样本集合汇总后写回
    2.样本有效状态、样本主状态、接收结论和报告状态仍由各样本自身维护
    3.样本包是申请单流转主流程内的一次性运输集合，可关联多个申请单的样本
    4.聚合内部关联以 ApplicationId、SpecimenId、PackageId、DispatchRecordId、ReceiptRecordId、ExceptionRecordId、LabReportId 为准
    5.ApplicationNo、SpecimenBarcode、PackageCode、DispatchRecordNo、ReceiptRecordNo、ExceptionRecordNo 等业务号仅作为展示、外部定位和追溯字段
    6.申请审核仅允许按单个申请单逐条执行，不提供批量审核；批量终止本轮 UML 暂不展开
    7.发起科室只保存 InitiatorDeptId；查询时通过组织服务获取当前名称，页面不展示科室编码或内部 ID
    8.发起医生只保存 InitiatorDoctorId；查询时通过用户服务获取当前姓名，页面不展示医生编码或内部 ID
    9.ApplicationNo 和 InitiatorApplicationNo 在创建后不可修改
    10.不定义 Application 或 Specimen 通用物理删除命令和领域事件；停止流转使用申请取消、样本终止及既有业务纠错动作
]

Entity('ApplicationItemEntity')[
    申请项目明细
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    申请单ID(ApplicationId Guid)
    发起院区项目编码(InitiatorItemCode String)
    发起院区项目名称(InitiatorItemName String)
    标准医疗项目编码(StandardItemCode String)
    标准医疗项目名称(StandardItemName String)
    标准医疗项目分类名称(StandardItemCategoryName String?)
    标准医疗项目分组名称(StandardItemGroupName String?)
    项目加急标识(IsUrgent Boolean)
    费用状态(FeeStatus FeeStatus?)
    费用总金额(TotalFee Decimal(10,2)?)
    是否医保支付(InsurancePaidStatus InsurancePaidStatus?)
    费用发生时间(FeeOccurredTime DateTime?)
    医保类型(InsuranceType InsuranceType?)
    医保支付金额(InsurancePaidAmount Decimal(10,2)?)
    个人支付金额(SelfPaidAmount Decimal(10,2)?)
    费用备注(FeeRemark String?)
]

Entity('SpecimenEntity')[
    样本
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    申请单ID(ApplicationId Guid)
    样本条码(SpecimenBarcode String)
    样本类型(SpecimenType String)
    采样时间(SamplingTime DateTime?)
    采样人(SamplerName String?)
    容器编码(ContainerCode String?)
    容器名称(ContainerName String)
    实际检测开始时间(TestingStartedTime DateTime?)
    检测开始备注(TestingStartedRemark String?)
    样本有效状态(BarcodeStatus BarcodeStatus)
    结束类型(EndType BarcodeEndType?)
    终止类型(TerminationType BarcodeTerminationType?)
    终止原因(TerminationReason BarcodeTerminationReason?)
    终止说明(TerminationDescription String?)
    终止时间(TerminationTime DateTime?)
    终止发起方(TerminatedByOrg String?)
    终止时样本主状态(TerminatedAtMainStatus SpecimenMainStatus?)
    终止时报告状态摘要(TerminatedAtReportStatus LabReportStatus?)
    样本主状态(SpecimenMainStatus SpecimenMainStatus)
    最终接收结论(ReceiptConclusion FinalReceiptConclusion?)
    报告状态(ReportStatus LabReportStatus?)
    当前送出记录ID(CurrentDispatchRecordId Guid?)
    当前接收记录ID(CurrentReceiptRecordId Guid?)
    --规则--
    1.ApplicationId、CurrentDispatchRecordId、CurrentReceiptRecordId 是内部关联依据
    2.申请编号通过所属 ApplicationAggregate 取得；SpecimenBarcode 在样本形成后不可修改，用于展示、扫码识别、外部定位和追溯
    3.样本条码、样本类型、采样和容器事实来自后端调用接收方条码生成适配器后的结果；采样时间、采样人、容器编码、实际检测开始时间和检测开始备注持久化到 lis_specimen
    4.样本本体不保存送出时间；样本级送出时间从当前有效 DispatchSpecimenEntity.DispatchTime 推导
]

Entity('SpecimenCoveredItemEntity')[
    样本覆盖项目明细
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    样本ID(SpecimenId Guid)
    发起院区项目编码(InitiatorItemCode String)
    发起院区项目名称(InitiatorItemName String)
    标准医疗项目编码(StandardItemCode String)
    标准医疗项目名称(StandardItemName String)
    项目加急标识(IsUrgent Boolean)
    费用状态(FeeStatus FeeStatus?)
    费用总金额(TotalFee Decimal(10,2)?)
    是否医保支付(InsurancePaidStatus InsurancePaidStatus?)
    费用发生时间(FeeOccurredTime DateTime?)
    医保类型(InsuranceType InsuranceType?)
    --规则--
    1.SpecimenId 是唯一归属关联；申请和条码信息经所属 SpecimenEntity、ApplicationAggregate 取得
    2.覆盖项目清单来自后端调用接收方条码生成适配器后的结果，必须能回溯当前申请项目明细
]

Entity('SpecimenPackageEntity')[
    样本包
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    包编码(PackageCode String)
    发起医院编码(InitiatorHospitalCode String)
    发起院区编码(InitiatorBranchCode String)
    接收医院编码(ReceiverHospitalCode String)
    接收院区编码(ReceiverBranchCode String)
    包名称(PackageName String)
    包状态(PackageStatus SpecimenPackageStatus)
    包交接状态(PackageHandoverStatus PackageHandoverStatus)
    送出时间(DispatchTime DateTime?)
    包接收时间(PackageReceiveTime DateTime?)
    包接收备注(PackageReceiveRemark String?)
    作废原因(VoidReason SpecimenPackageVoidReason?)
    作废说明(VoidDescription String?)
    作废时间(VoidedTime DateTime?)
    创建时间(CreatedTime DateTime)
    --规则--
    1.ID 是内部关联依据
    2.PackageCode 仅用于展示、外部定位、按包扫码或追溯
    3.PackageHandoverStatus 仅表示未送出、已送出、已接收的包级交接进度；包内样本最终处理以接收样本明细为准
]

Entity('PackageSpecimenEntity')[
    包内样本引用
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    包ID(PackageId Guid)
    包编码(PackageCode String)
    申请单ID(ApplicationId Guid)
    样本ID(SpecimenId Guid)
    平台申请单号(ApplicationNo String)
    发起方申请单号(InitiatorApplicationNo String?)
    样本条码(SpecimenBarcode String)
    患者信息摘要(PatientSummary String?)
    样本信息摘要(SpecimenSummary String?)
    项目清单摘要(ProjectSummary String?)
    加入时间(AddedTime DateTime)
    是否补录(IsSupplemented Boolean)
    补录原因(SupplementReason PackageSpecimenSupplementReason?)
    补录说明(SupplementDescription String?)
    补录时间(SupplementTime DateTime?)
    补录来源(SupplementSource String?)
    --规则--
    1.ApplicationId 和 SpecimenId 是稳定内部关联依据
    2.ApplicationNo、InitiatorApplicationNo、SpecimenBarcode 和摘要是包清单形成或补录时的业务快照，后续不得用当前主数据覆盖
    3.PackageCode 用于展示、扫码识别、外部定位和追溯
    4.补录字段仅用于标记送出后追加进入原包当前应接收清单的样本
]

Entity('DispatchRecordEntity')[
    送出记录
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    包ID(PackageId Guid)
    送出记录号(DispatchRecordNo String)
    发起医院编码(InitiatorHospitalCode String)
    发起院区编码(InitiatorBranchCode String)
    接收医院编码(ReceiverHospitalCode String)
    接收院区编码(ReceiverBranchCode String)
    包编码(PackageCode String)
    送出时间(DispatchTime DateTime)
    送出记录状态(DispatchRecordStatus DispatchRecordStatus)
    业务标签(BusinessTags String?)
    送出备注(DispatchRemark String?)
    撤销原因(CancelReason DispatchCancelReason?)
    撤销说明(CancelDescription String?)
    撤销时间(CancelTime DateTime?)
    撤销操作人(CancelledOperId Guid?)
    --规则--
    1.PackageId 是包级送出事实的归属关联；记录头不具有单一申请归属
    2.DispatchRecordNo、PackageCode 用于展示、外部定位和追溯；申请归属由 DispatchSpecimenEntity 逐样本表达
    3.DispatchRecordStatus=Cancelled 表示整包误送出已撤销，包可回到未送出；AllWithdrawn 表示样本级全部撤回，原包不恢复编辑
]

Entity('DispatchSpecimenEntity')[
    送出样本明细
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    送出记录ID(DispatchRecordId Guid)
    申请单ID(ApplicationId Guid)
    样本ID(SpecimenId Guid)
    平台申请单号(ApplicationNo String)
    样本条码(SpecimenBarcode String)
    发起方申请单号(InitiatorApplicationNo String?)
    患者信息摘要(PatientSummary String)
    标准医疗项目编码清单(StandardItemCodes String[])
    样本级送出时间(DispatchTime DateTime)
    是否补录(IsSupplemented Boolean)
    补录原因(SupplementReason PackageSpecimenSupplementReason?)
    补录说明(SupplementDescription String?)
    补录时间(SupplementTime DateTime?)
    补录来源(SupplementSource String?)
    是否撤回(IsWithdrawn Boolean)
    撤回原因(WithdrawReason String?)
    撤回时间(WithdrawTime DateTime?)
    --规则--
    1.DispatchRecordId、ApplicationId 和 SpecimenId 是稳定内部关联依据
    2.ApplicationNo、InitiatorApplicationNo、SpecimenBarcode、患者和项目摘要是样本送出时的业务快照，后续不得用当前主数据覆盖
    3.DispatchTime 表示样本纳入当前有效送出关系的时间，普通按包送出等于送出记录时间，补录样本等于补录送出时间或补录确认时间
]

Entity('ReceiptRecordEntity')[
    接收记录
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    包ID(PackageId Guid)
    接收记录号(ReceiptRecordNo String)
    接收医院编码(ReceiverHospitalCode String)
    接收院区编码(ReceiverBranchCode String)
    接收科室ID(ReceiverDeptId Guid?)
    发起医院编码(InitiatorHospitalCode String)
    发起院区编码(InitiatorBranchCode String)
    当前有效送出记录ID(DispatchRecordId Guid)
    包编码(PackageCode String)
    接收处理结果(ReceiptResult ReceiptResult)
    最终接收结论(FinalReceiptConclusion FinalReceiptConclusion?)
    接收时间(ReceiptTime DateTime)
    接收备注(ReceiptRemark String?)
    --规则--
    1.PackageId 和 DispatchRecordId 是包级/拆分接收事实的内部关联；记录头不具有单一申请归属
    2.ReceiptRecordNo、PackageCode 用于展示、外部定位和追溯；申请归属由 ReceiptSpecimenEntity 逐样本表达
    3.ReceiverDeptId 为接收动作发生时从 token 解析的接收方科室 ID；编码和名称查询时通过组织服务获取，不落库
]

Entity('ReceiptSpecimenEntity')[
    接收样本明细
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    接收记录ID(ReceiptRecordId Guid)
    包ID(PackageId Guid)
    申请单ID(ApplicationId Guid)
    样本ID(SpecimenId Guid)
    平台申请单号(ApplicationNo String)
    样本条码(SpecimenBarcode String)
    当前有效送出记录ID(DispatchRecordId Guid)
    包编码(PackageCode String)
    接收处理结果(ReceiptResult ReceiptResult)
    异常类型编码(ExceptionTypeCode String?)
    异常类型名称(ExceptionTypeName String?)
    异常描述(ExceptionDescription String?)
    未到货说明(NotArrivedDescription String?)
    接收备注(ReceiptRemark String?)
    --规则--
    1.ReceiptRecordId、PackageId、DispatchRecordId、ApplicationId 和 SpecimenId 是稳定内部关联依据
    2.ApplicationNo、SpecimenBarcode 是本次接收结果形成时的业务快照，后续不得用当前主数据覆盖；PackageCode 用于业务定位和追溯
]

Entity('ExceptionRecordEntity')[
    异常记录
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    异常记录号(ExceptionRecordNo String)
    申请单ID(ApplicationId Guid)
    样本ID(SpecimenId Guid)
    平台申请单号(ApplicationNo String)
    样本条码(SpecimenBarcode String)
    发起医院编码(InitiatorHospitalCode String)
    发起院区编码(InitiatorBranchCode String)
    接收医院编码(ReceiverHospitalCode String)
    接收院区编码(ReceiverBranchCode String)
    异常来源(ExceptionSource SpecimenExceptionSource)
    异常类型编码(ExceptionTypeCode String)
    异常类型名称(ExceptionTypeName String)
    异常描述(ExceptionDescription String?)
    异常状态(ExceptionStatus SpecimenExceptionStatus)
    处理结果(ProcessResult SpecimenExceptionProcessResult?)
    处理原因编码(ProcessReasonCode String?)
    处理原因名称(ProcessReasonName String?)
    处理说明(ProcessDescription String?)
    发现人(DiscoveredBy String?)
    发现时间(DiscoveredTime DateTime)
    处理人(ProcessedBy String?)
    处理时间(ProcessedTime DateTime?)
    关联接收记录ID(ReceiptRecordId Guid?)
    关联送出记录ID(DispatchRecordId Guid?)
    --规则--
    1.ApplicationId、SpecimenId、ReceiptRecordId、DispatchRecordId 是稳定内部关联依据
    2.ApplicationNo、SpecimenBarcode 和机构范围是异常发现时的业务定位快照，处理异常不得改写；ExceptionRecordNo 用于展示、外部定位和追溯
]

Entity('LabReportEntity')[
    报告
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    样本ID(SpecimenId Guid)
    报告PDF(PdfFileKey String)
    原始PDF文件名(PdfOriginalFileName String)
    接收方检验流水号(ReceiverLabSerialNo String?)
    报告单类别编码(ReportCategoryCode String?)
    报告单类别名称(ReportCategoryName String?)
    检验人ID(InspectorId Guid?)
    检验时间(InspectionTime DateTime?)
    检测完成时间(TestingCompletedTime DateTime)
    检验小组(InspectionGroupName String?)
    检测仪器(InspectionInstrumentName String?)
    出报告人ID(ReporterId Guid?)
    出报告科室ID(ReportDeptId Guid?)
    报告时间(ReportTime DateTime)
    实验室内部审核人ID(InternalReviewerId Guid?)
    实验室内部审核时间(InternalReviewTime DateTime?)
    报告备注(ReportRemark String?)
    上传时间(UploadedTime DateTime)
    报告状态(ReportStatus LabReportStatus)
    是否当前有效报告(IsCurrentEffective Boolean)
    作废原因编码(VoidReasonCode String?)
    作废原因名称(VoidReasonName String?)
    作废说明(VoidDescription String?)
    作废时间(VoidedTime DateTime?)
    作废人(VoidedBy String?)
    --规则--
    1.SpecimenId 是报告唯一业务归属关联；申请编号和样本条码经 SpecimenEntity、ApplicationAggregate 取得
    2.ReceiverLabSerialNo 用于展示、外部定位和追溯
    3.ReportDeptId 为报告形成时保存的出报告科室 ID；科室名称查询时通过组织服务获取，不落库
    4.InspectorId、InternalReviewerId、ReporterId 来自上传请求中的平台用户 ID；新上传必填，历史迁移记录可为空
    5.查询时通过 IUserAppService 返回三类人员当前姓名；人员姓名、编码和工号不落库
    6.InspectionGroupName、InspectionInstrumentName 和报告发生时间来自接收方报告内容
]

Entity('LabResultItemEntity')[
    报告结构化结果明细
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    报告ID(LabReportId Guid)
    接收方报告明细项目编码(ReceiverReportItemCode String)
    接收方报告明细项目名称(ReceiverReportItemName String)
    结果类型(ResultType LabResultType)
    项目结果(ResultValue String)
    定性结果(QualitativeResult String?)
    定量结果(QuantitativeResult String?)
    单位(Unit String?)
    参考区间(ReferenceRange String?)
    异常标记(AbnormalFlag String?)
    危急值标记(CriticalValueFlag String?)
    结果代码(ResultCode String?)
    结果说明(ResultDescription String?)
    --规则--
    1.LabReportId 是唯一归属关联；申请、样本和业务编号经 LabReportEntity、SpecimenEntity、ApplicationAggregate 取得
    2.接收方报告明细项目编码、接收方报告明细项目名称、结果类型和项目结果为必填字段
    3.结果类型仅表达结构化结果数据形态，不作为医学含义字典
    4.数值型结果也必须保留项目结果原始展示值；定量结果仅保存可解析数值，不替代项目结果
    5.危急值标记仅用于报告展示和查询，不触发平台危急值流程
    6.接收方报告明细项目编码不作为院区项目对照维护对象
]

'============================================= 关系 =============================================
CreateApplicationCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
CreateApplicationCommand .. ApplicationItemEntity

CancelApplicationCommand .. ApplicationAggregate

ApproveApplicationCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
ApproveApplicationCommand --> SpecimenEntity
ApproveApplicationCommand --> SpecimenCoveredItemEntity
RejectApplicationCommand .. ApplicationAggregate

CreateSpecimenPackageCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
CreateSpecimenPackageCommand --> SpecimenPackageEntity
CreateSpecimenPackageCommand .. PackageSpecimenEntity
AdjustSpecimenPackageCommand .. PackageSpecimenEntity
DispatchSpecimenPackageCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
DispatchSpecimenPackageCommand --> MarkSpecimenPackageDispatchedCommand
DispatchSpecimenPackageCommand --> SpecimenEntity
DispatchSpecimenPackageCommand .. DispatchRecordEntity
DispatchSpecimenPackageCommand .. DispatchSpecimenEntity
MarkSpecimenPackageDispatchedCommand .. SpecimenPackageEntity
SupplementDispatchedPackageSpecimensCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
SupplementDispatchedPackageSpecimensCommand --> AddSupplementedPackageSpecimensCommand
SupplementDispatchedPackageSpecimensCommand --> SpecimenEntity
SupplementDispatchedPackageSpecimensCommand .. DispatchSpecimenEntity
AddSupplementedPackageSpecimensCommand .. PackageSpecimenEntity
VoidSpecimenPackageCommand .. SpecimenPackageEntity

TerminateSpecimenCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
TerminateSpecimenCommand --> SpecimenEntity
TerminateSpecimenCommand .. ExceptionRecordEntity

CancelSpecimenPackageDispatchCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
CancelSpecimenPackageDispatchCommand --> MarkDispatchRecordCancelledCommand
CancelSpecimenPackageDispatchCommand --> MarkSpecimenPackagePendingDispatchCommand
CancelSpecimenPackageDispatchCommand --> SpecimenEntity
CancelSpecimenPackageDispatchCommand .. DispatchSpecimenEntity
MarkDispatchRecordCancelledCommand .. DispatchRecordEntity
MarkSpecimenPackagePendingDispatchCommand .. SpecimenPackageEntity
WithdrawSpecimenDispatchCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
WithdrawSpecimenDispatchCommand --> SpecimenEntity
WithdrawSpecimenDispatchCommand .. DispatchSpecimenEntity

ConfirmSpecimenPackageReceiptCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
ConfirmSpecimenPackageReceiptCommand --> MarkSpecimenPackageReceivedCommand
ConfirmSpecimenPackageReceiptCommand ..> ReceiptRecordEntity
ConfirmSpecimenPackageReceiptCommand ..> ReceiptSpecimenEntity
ConfirmSpecimenPackageReceiptCommand --> SpecimenEntity
ConfirmSpecimenPackageReceiptCommand .. ExceptionRecordEntity
ConfirmSupplementalSpecimenReceiptCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
ConfirmSupplementalSpecimenReceiptCommand ..> ReceiptRecordEntity
ConfirmSupplementalSpecimenReceiptCommand ..> ReceiptSpecimenEntity
ConfirmSupplementalSpecimenReceiptCommand --> SpecimenEntity
ConfirmSupplementalSpecimenReceiptCommand .. ExceptionRecordEntity
MarkSpecimenPackageReceivedCommand .. SpecimenPackageEntity
RegisterSpecimenExceptionCommand .. ExceptionRecordEntity
ProcessSpecimenExceptionCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
ProcessSpecimenExceptionCommand --> SpecimenEntity
ProcessSpecimenExceptionCommand .. ExceptionRecordEntity

StartSpecimenTestingCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
StartSpecimenTestingCommand --> SpecimenEntity
UploadLabReportCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
UploadLabReportCommand --> SpecimenEntity
UploadLabReportCommand .. LabReportEntity
UploadLabReportCommand .. LabResultItemEntity
VoidLabReportCommand .. ApplicationAggregate
VoidLabReportCommand --> SpecimenEntity
VoidLabReportCommand .. LabReportEntity

ApplicationAggregate .. ApplicationItemEntity
ApplicationAggregate .. SpecimenEntity
SpecimenEntity .. SpecimenCoveredItemEntity
ApplicationAggregate .. SpecimenPackageEntity
SpecimenPackageEntity .. PackageSpecimenEntity
ApplicationAggregate .. DispatchRecordEntity
DispatchRecordEntity .. DispatchSpecimenEntity
ApplicationAggregate .. ReceiptRecordEntity
ReceiptRecordEntity .. ReceiptSpecimenEntity
ApplicationAggregate .. ExceptionRecordEntity
ApplicationAggregate .. LabReportEntity
LabReportEntity .. LabResultItemEntity

@enduml
